less&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=luFGAbMGl8wQ7kNvwHxT_kb&_nc_oc=AdrRWPDJ96KXceb2uI2Bzd2pyhov5b0i_BZDZIkDuyHjtJRkWyoBy5XzUh_ZMqNthNg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSIpVUZfTdAuRlE4Mq4oVotgCvItYyr0IKixtJtTM6uVg&oe=6AFC771A"}, {"file_name": "screen-4.png", "id": "510210628338938", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031359_510210631672271_3889054620789481961_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RIyqH_PukWYQ7kNvwElPXHp&_nc_oc=AdoFExwz9_fPwt8M7Xc_eTopB_jm7LfPlMuSV0a2zpnP4VsqD6uG1AgIdgiemiVeSCw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTpydMYUxZyy5IBJgUNyd-oMokOsljup-bAVffh-_Lqtw&oe=6AFC7D93"}, {"file_name": "screen-5.png", "id": "1241621836834075", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031652_1241621840167408_8711678203036836320_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HLE0e5i2BCgQ7kNvwEpsHmD&_nc_oc=Adpcui2De8akpTRFRB3KPn-j1aPjxLS7npcUUyAVMxjTlS5Eq7vUUpyVDXUElj9nfPA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR-2kOpY-PL2cYzF5NDhmL6fV-KSdcLXNsE5y0FYJpHwg&oe=6AFC929F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Mod3_Title.png", "id": "3693715237561510", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036644_3693715240894843_8945723129178385145_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5m1nIHaN40EQ7kNvwEu6-kr&_nc_oc=AdpmAQInYkT6CWCLFnKzon8moKQP6SfBtKRnBm3CXnzRR7Hgjvhjoaqex2q2EksRfHM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQtte8RatJUXTz1V-zWCo6Y11aetK8-peb8q5GJvjPBbw&oe=6AFC71FE"}, "display_name": "Hololab VR - NCSG Inspection Foundation Module 3: Masonry Wood External", "keywords": [], "long_description": "**Hololab NCSG Wood Burning Freestanding Stoves VR Application**\n\nThe Hololab National Chimney Sweep Guild VR application provides users with essential skills to inspect and maintain wood-burning freestanding stoves in compliance with NCSG standards. This course features interactive slide content, desktop-based activities, realistic simulations, and detailed testing. Users are challenged to perform inspections with randomized issues in a virtual residential setting, ensuring all necessary procedures are followed.\n\n**VR Controls and PPE \u2013** Learn how to navigate the virtual environment while getting acquainted with essential personal protective equipment.\n\n**Responsibility & Worksite Hazard Assessment \u2013** Operate in a simulated environment to identify and mitigate hazards commonly encountered during inspections of wood-burning freestanding stoves.\n\n**Familiarization \u2013** Understand different types of wood-burning freestanding stoves and their common features.\n\n**Freestanding Stove Inspection \u2013** Utilize the official NCSG checklist to thoroughly inspect wood-burning freestanding stoves.\n\n**Real-World Simulation \u2013** Complete the inspection by correctly identifying issues with maximum safety awareness and forensic skills.\n\nData reports for review are saved and stored for engagement metrics and simulation performance analysis.\n\nAny off-platform monetization of content accessible in this app conforms to the Oculus Bulk IAP or Subscription Licenses app policy outlined here: https://developer.oculus.com/policy/app-policies", "short_description": "The Hololab National Chimney Sweep Guild Wood Burning Freestanding Stoves VR application provides users with essential skills to inspect and maintain wood-burning freestanding stoves in compliance with NCSG standards. This course features interactive slide content, desktop-based activities, realistic simulations, and detailed testing."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://ftfvr.com/privacy-app/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "From the Future", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www